  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Driving Action for Nature and Climate in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Driving Action for Nature and Climate in Southeast Asia

Deforestation from new and emerging threats to Indonesia&apos;s forests is reduced or, in the case of key state-backed developmet projects, even stopped.

CSOs across Indonesia are engaged in strategic advocacy to proect forests. CSOs are represented in decision-making processes that affect them, and are collaborating with one another and with international NGOs.</narrative>
  </description>
